            <p><b>~~sectionHeading3()~~</b></p><p><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">Person Serial No</span></b></font>&nbsp;-<font color="#ff0000">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q1(S3AQ2)~~)</font></b><font color="#0000ff">&nbsp;</font></span><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">Name -</span></b></font><font color="#ff0000">&nbsp;</font><b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)</font><font color="#0000ff">&nbsp;</font></span></b><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">Age -</span></b></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q7(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b></p><p><b><font color="#ff00ff">S3AQ171:&nbsp;</font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>How long has </b></span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><b><span style="font-size: 16px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b><font color="#ff0000"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">been suffering from that illness ? Years</b></p><p></p>
          SI: |
            <p><b>~~sectionHeading3()~~</b></p><p><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;">පුද්ගල අනුක්‍රමික අංකය</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<b style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q1(S3AQ2)~~)&nbsp;</font></b><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;">නම</b><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;-</span></b></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)&nbsp;</font></span></b><font color="#0000ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color="#ff00ff"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b>වයස&nbsp;-</b></span></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q7(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b></p><p><b><font color="#ff00ff"><span style="font-size: 16px;">S3AQ171:&nbsp;</span></font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;</span></b><b><span style="font-size: 16px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b><font color="#ff0000"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><font face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b style=""><font color="#0000ff"><span style="font-size: 16px;">කොපමණ කාලයක සිට එම රෝගයෙන් පෙලෙන්නේද? </span></font><font color="#9c00ff"><span style="font-size: 16px;">වර්ෂ ගණන</span></font></b></span></font></p><p></p>
          TA: |
            <p><b>~~sectionHeading3()~~</b></p><p><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;">நபரின் தொடரிலக்கம்</b>&nbsp;-<font color="#ff0000">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q1(S3AQ2)~~)</font></b><font color="#0000ff">&nbsp;</font></span><font color="#ff00ff"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b>பெயர்&nbsp;-</b></span></font><font color="#ff0000">&nbsp;</font><b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)</font><font color="#0000ff">&nbsp;</font></span></b><font color="#ff00ff"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b>வயது&nbsp;-</b></span></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q7(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b></p><p><b><font color="#ff00ff">S3AQ171:&nbsp;</font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><b><span style="font-size: 16px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b><font color="#ff0000"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></font><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>எவ்வளவு காலமாக அந்த நோய்/ அங்கவீனத்தினால் பாதிக்கப்பட்டுள்ளீர்கள்? வருடங்களின் எண்ணிக்கையை குறிப்பிடுக</b></span></font></p><p></p>
