            <p><b>~~sectionHeading3()~~</b></p><p><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;">පුද්ගල අනුක්‍රමික අංකය</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<b style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q1(S3AQ2)~~)&nbsp;</font></b><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;">නම</b><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;-</span></b></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)&nbsp;</font></span></b><font color="#0000ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color="#ff00ff"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b>වයස&nbsp;-</b></span></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q7(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b></p><p><b><font color="#ff00ff">S3AQ18:&nbsp;</font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><b><span style="font-size: 18px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3AQ2)~~)</font></span></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>මෙම රෝග තත්ත්වය නිසා පසුගිය මාසය තුල සාමාන්‍ය&nbsp; කටයුතු වලින්/ රැකියා වලින් බැහැරව සිටියේද?</b></span></font></p><p></p>
