              <p><b>~~sectionHeading3B()~~</b></p><p><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">Person Serial No</span></b></font>&nbsp;-<font color="#ff0000">&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q1(S3BQ2)~~)</font></b><font color="#0000ff">&nbsp;</font></span><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">Name -</span></b></font><font color="#ff0000">&nbsp;</font><b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(S3BQ2)~~)</font><font color="#0000ff">&nbsp;</font></span></b><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">Age -</span></b></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q7(S3BQ2)~~)</font></span></b></p><p><b><font color="#ff00ff">S3BQ7:</font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">Does<span style="font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;</span></b><font color="#ff0000"><span style="font-size: 16px;"><b>(~~S1Q2(S3BQ2)~~)</b></span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>has difficalty to walk short distance or climb up or down 12 steps ?</b></span></font></p><p></p>
