            <p><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 16px;">C02</span></b></font><font color="#295218"><span style="font-size: 16px;">:</span></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;</b><font color="#ff0000"><b>(~~S1Q2(C1Q1)~~)</b></font><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;</b><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>Child weight&nbsp; &nbsp;</b></font></p><p><b style="font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><font color="#ff0000">Use health development record book of the child</font></b></p><p><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>(in kilograms)</b></font></p><p></p><p></p>
          SI: |
            <p></p><p><b>~~sectionHeading10()~~</b></p><p><b>&nbsp;</b><b><font color="#9c00ff">~~sectionHeading603()~~</font></b></p><p><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;">පුද්ගල අනුක්‍රමික අංකය</b>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 14px;"><b><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q1(C1Q1)~~)&nbsp;</font></b></span><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 255); font-size: 14px;">නම</b><font color="#ff00ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;-</span></b></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q2(C1Q1)~~)&nbsp;</font></span></b><font color="#0000ff"><b><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color="#ff00ff"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b>වයස&nbsp;-</b></span></font>&nbsp;<b><span style="font-size: 14px;"><font color="#ff0000">(~~S1Q7(C1Q1)~~)</font></span></b></p>
            
            <p><b><span style="font-size: 18px;"><font color="#ff00ff"><span style="font-size: 16px;">C02</span></font><font color="#295218"><span style="font-size: 16px;">:&nbsp;</span></font></span></b><b style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</b><font color="#ff0000"><b>(~~S1Q2(C1Q1)~~)</b></font><b style="color: rgb(41, 82, 24);">&nbsp;</b><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>දරුවාගේ බර&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font></p><p><b style="font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><font color="#ff0000">දරුවාගේ සෞඛ්‍ය වර්ධන සටහන් පත යොදාගන්න.&nbsp;</font></b></p><p><font color="#0000ff" face="Calibri, Candara, Segoe, Segoe UI, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>(කිලෝ ග්‍රෑම් වලින්) ?</b></font></p><p></p><p></p>
