            <p><b>~~sectionHeading54()~~</b></p><p><b><font color="#ff00ff">S54A:&nbsp;</font></b><b><font color="#0000ff">Did any&nbsp; of the household members (usual residence)&nbsp; engage in any non – agricultural activities such as industry, construction, trade and services as an employer or own account worker for sale or receiving income during last calendar&nbsp; &nbsp;months?&nbsp;</font></b></p>
