              <p><b>~~sectionHeading43()~~</b></p><p><b><font color="#ff00ff">S43AQ2:&nbsp;</font></b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">&nbsp;</b><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"><b>Did&nbsp;</b></span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;">Boarders and / or Domestic servants&nbsp;</b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-size: 16px;">&nbsp;</span></b><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Calibri, Candara, Segoe, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Optima, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;"><b>make expenses on Housing, Food, Cloths, Health expenses, Fuel, Light, Transport,&nbsp; Non-durable goods,&nbsp; Services &amp; Consumer durable goods,Sports, Recreation, Entertainments, Cultural &amp; Riligious activites, Education, communication, money transfer to familly, savings, provident funds, W &amp; O P, taxes, insurance, Gift etc. during last month.&nbsp;</b></span></p><p></p><p></p>
